OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,For drizzle, drier at first in the
OL,7,Feast. Rain becoming more persistent
OL,8,Fand widespread during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fwith a few heavier bursts possible.
OL,10,FLight winds for most, but breezy near
OL,11,Fthe coast. Feeling rather cool.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy for much of the night,
OL,14,Finitial rain soon becoming patchy and
OL,15,Fdrizzly into the evening, with perhaps
OL,16,Fa few clear spells developing later in
OL,17,Fthe night. Winds mostly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
